Usage: hyprluggage <command> [options]

Commands:
  switch [theme]     Switch theme (menu if no name given)
  browse             Browse & import Omarchy themes with preview
  import <url>       Import Omarchy theme from GitHub
  apply-aether [dir] [name]
                     Convert an Aether theme into themes/<name> (aether)
  tui                Theme browser, shell & working-terminal pickers
  list               Show all themes
  current            Print current theme
  reload             Re-apply current theme
  fix                Fix broken symlinks
  doctor             Health report (read-only)
  update [tag]       Update to latest (or given) v* release tag
  rollback           Restore the previous ref from the last update
  remove <theme>     Delete a theme
  uninstall          Delete themes, or remove theme config
  help               This help
  version            Version info

Keybindings:
  SUPER+I                     Hyprluggage TUI
  SUPER+SHIFT+I               Web app install
  SUPER+CTRL+SHIFT+SPACE      Theme switcher
  SUPER+CTRL+SPACE            Matugen theme from wallpaper
  SUPER+ALT+SPACE             Wallpaper picker
  SUPER+ALT+LEFT/RIGHT        Cycle wallpapers
  SUPER+BACKSPACE             Toggle terminal transparency
  SUPER+CTRL+BACKSPACE        Toggle focus/vibe mode
  SUPER+K                     Show all keybindings

Tip:
  Waybar palette icon: left-click opens the theme switcher, right-click picks a wallpaper, middle-click applies a random wallpaper
  Waybar brightness icon: scroll to change the focused monitor, right-click to toggle nightlight

Examples:
  hyprluggage switch
  hyprluggage switch tokyo-night
  hyprluggage import bjarneo/omarchy-sakura-theme
  hyprluggage import https://github.com/user/omarchy-theme
  hyprluggage apply-aether
  hyprluggage apply-aether ~/.config/aether/theme forest

